{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each of us is a star-are you ready to find out what makes you burn?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>3025</strong>, and Earth is on the brink. In just five short years, all resources will be depleted, and the only way off the planet is a ticket that costs <strong>1,000,000 Omnis</strong>. You start with nothing. Will you turn nothing into something-and maybe, something into everything? Or will you lose yourself chasing society\u2019s materialistic comforts, forever stranded in the crumbling world of <strong>Alterra</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Alterra\u2019s vast map lie <strong>multiple jobs</strong>, each offering a distinct, skill-based experience to earn your way forward. Will you climb the corporate ladder and serve the machine? Or forge your own path, building wealth through unconventional means?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is life in 3025 just about working-or is there something more waiting to be discovered?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your purpose. Burn bright. Your destiny awaits among the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.poster.avif?t=1755653228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.webm?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.mp4?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work to survive. Or thrive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling, interactive map and travel between unique locations, each offering different job and leisure opportunities. Your journey begins at the <strong>Energy Management Network (EMN)</strong>-Alterra's primary power provider. As a <strong>Digital Miner</strong>, your task is simple: <strong>produce power and remember who you work for</strong>. The better you perform, the more energy you generate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8e3cc06f9b0e1dfb2ccd18f5db1ee267.poster.avif?t=1755653228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8e3cc06f9b0e1dfb2ccd18f5db1ee267.webm?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8e3cc06f9b0e1dfb2ccd18f5db1ee267.mp4?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the ranks. Power your escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job provides a unique path to gain experience and prove your worth. At EMN, the more energy you collect, the closer you are to a promotion. Use your hard-earned power to upgrade your mining rig-or trade it for Omnis and fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/fd6b5fe4f802e5755b44b09779d5d917.poster.avif?t=1755653228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/fd6b5fe4f802e5755b44b09779d5d917.webm?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/fd6b5fe4f802e5755b44b09779d5d917.mp4?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take some time off and enjoy what Alterra has to offer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not only filled with various job locations but leisure opportunities as well. Lyra's Shining Star is Alterra's Prime Casino, offering multiple fun ways to earn some Omnis.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.poster.avif?t=1755653228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.webm?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.mp4?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is there more to life than just working?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries are woven into every corner of Alterra-will you connect the clues and uncover what truly lies beyond the stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/02c8f20f41346432d0f8a524bc1453df.poster.avif?t=1755653228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/02c8f20f41346432d0f8a524bc1453df.webm?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/02c8f20f41346432d0f8a524bc1453df.mp4?t=1755653228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908670?t=1755653228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/2be0c534ad4ac0a7465cc22a0717bbe8d25037e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755653228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/6968a6e7296f3b3d1671ad28ed79785563347e2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755653228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/6968a6e7296f3b3d1671ad28ed79785563347e2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755653228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each of us is a star-are you ready to find out what makes you burn?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>3025</strong>, and Earth is on the brink. In just five short years, all resources will be depleted, and the only way off the planet is a ticket that costs <strong>1,000,000 Omnis</strong>. You start with nothing. Will you turn nothing into something-and maybe, something into everything? Or will you lose yourself chasing society\u2019s materialistic comforts, forever stranded in the crumbling world of <strong>Alterra</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Alterra\u2019s vast map lie <strong>multiple jobs</strong>, each offering a distinct, skill-based experience to earn your way forward. Will you climb the corporate ladder and serve the machine? Or forge your own path, building wealth through unconventional means?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is life in 3025 just about working-or is there something more waiting to be discovered?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your purpose. Burn bright. Your destiny awaits among the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe